3b6a91acdf0cb8f03230d170b03254d1780bdf4c3d6ce459e&lang=sv"},"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/TECH"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/OTHER"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A list in English of all classes in the German Patent Classification (DPK, Deutsche Patentklassifikation). Each class has a link to a PDF document that contains the class and its subclasses in English.\n\nAn introduction to the German Patent Classification (DPK) is available here:\nhttps://www.prv.se/en/patents/patent-online-services/the-german-patent-classification-dpk/the-german-patent-classification-dpk-in-english/introduction-to-the-german-patent-classification-dpk/\n"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En lista på engelska på alla klasser i det tyska patentklassystemet (DPK, Deutsche Patentklassifikation). Varje klass har en länk till ett pdf-dokument som innehåller klassen och dess subklasser på engelska.\n\nEn introduktion till det tyska klassystemet finns här: https://www.prv.se/sv/patent/e-tjanster/den-tyska-patentklasslistan-dpk/the-german-patent-classification-dpk-in-english/introduktion-till-det-tyska-klassystemet-dpk/\n"}],"dct:identifier":"43cbd68a99da4113b6a91acdf0cb8f03230d170b03254d1780bdf4c3d6ce459e","dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021002072"},"dct:spatial":{"@id":"http://sws.geonames.org/2661886"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The German Patent Classification (DPK) in English"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Den tyska patentklasslistan (DPK) på engelska"}]},{"@id":"https://data.prv.se/distribution.jsp?uuid=43cbd68a99da4113b6a91acdf0cb8f03230d170b03254d1780bdf4c3d6ce459e","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://www.prv.se/en/patents/patent-online-services/the-german-patent-classification-dpk/the-german-patent-cl